Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Combinator 2
//
//  Pads 1-4   -> Combinator Buttons 1-4
//  Knobs 1-4A -> Combinator Rotaries 1-4 (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B -> Combinator globals (CC25-28): Enabled /
//                Run Pattern Devices / Bypass All FX / Select Patch Delta
//  Joystick X -> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y -> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard   -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	Combinator
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Combinator"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (Bank A) -> Combinator buttons -------------
Map	Pad 1		Button 1
Map	Pad 2		Button 2
Map	Pad 3		Button 3
Map	Pad 4		Button 4

// Pads 5-16 reserved (Combinator exposes 4 buttons only)
//Map	Pad 5		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 6		Select Next Patch

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): rotaries -----------------
Map	Knob 1 A		Rotary 1
Map	Knob 2 A		Rotary 2
Map	Knob 3 A		Rotary 3
Map	Knob 4 A		Rotary 4

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): global/patch controls ----
Map	Knob 1 B		Enabled
Map	Knob 2 B		Run Pattern Devices
Map	Knob 3 B		Bypass All FX
Map	Knob 4 B		Select Patch Delta

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel